    <!-- Subscription terms text, appears at the bottom of the subscriptions screen -->
    <string name="PaymentChooserActivity.SubscriptionsTerms">Ka soke biyan kuɗin ku kowane lokaci a cikin sashen biyan kuɗi akan Google Play. Lokacin da ka soke biyan kuɗin ku, za ka rasa dama ga abubuwan na daraja da aka bayar ta hanyar sharuɗɗan biyan kuɗin a ƙarshen lokacin biyan kuɗi na yanzu. Gwaji kyauta guda ɗaya kawai ga mai amfani. A ƙarshen lokacin gwajin kyauta, za a tura maka kuɗin adadin da ke cikin sharuɗɗan biyan kuɗin ku ta atomatik. Don guje wa caji, ka soke biyan kuɗin kafin lokacin gwaji ya ƙare.</string>

    <!-- Time pass explanation text -->
